@startuml
title NILM Federated Learning - Sequence Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n(Express)" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL\n(Prisma)" as DB
participant "FL Service\n(FastAPI)" as FLService

== Real-time Telemetry ==

User -> Frontend: Open Dashboard
activate Frontend

loop Every 2 seconds
  Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/nilm/sample
  activate Backend

  Backend -> Backend: Generate dummy sample
  Backend -> DB: Store TimeSeriesSample
  activate DB
  DB --> Backend: Sample stored
  deactivate DB

  Backend --> Frontend: Return sample data
  deactivate Backend

  Frontend -> Frontend: Update gauges
end

== NILM Inference ==

User -> Frontend: Click "Run NILM Inference"
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/nilm/infer
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Get last 50 main power values
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Window of samples
deactivate DB

Backend -> FLService: POST /infer\n{window: [values]}
activate FLService

FLService -> FLService: Run NILM model\n(disaggregate appliances)

FLService --> Backend: Appliance estimates
deactivate FLService

Backend -> DB: Store ApplianceEstimate
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Estimate stored
deactivate DB

Backend --> Frontend: Return estimate
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Frontend: Display estimates\nin gauges
deactivate Frontend

== Federated Training ==

User -> Frontend: Click "Start Local Training"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/training/start
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Get training samples
activate DB
DB --> Backend: 1000 samples
deactivate DB

Backend -> Backend: Simulate local training\n(5 epochs)

loop Poll every 1 second
  Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/training/status
  Backend --> Frontend: {progress: X%, status: running}
  Frontend -> Frontend: Update progress bar
end

Backend -> FLService: POST /federated/update\n{clientId, roundId, loss, accuracy}
activate FLService

FLService -> FLService: Aggregate updates\n(FedAvg)
FLService -> FLService: Update global model

FLService --> Backend: Global model metadata
deactivate FLService

Backend -> DB: Store ModelUpdate
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Update stored
deactivate DB

Backend -> DB: Create new ModelVersion
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Version stored
deactivate DB

Backend --> Frontend: Training complete
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Frontend: Show completion status
deactivate Frontend

== CSV Export ==

User -> Frontend: Click "Export Samples CSV"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/logs/export?type=samples
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Query TimeSeriesSample table
activate DB
DB --> Backend: All samples
deactivate DB

Backend -> Backend: Convert to CSV format

Backend --> Frontend: CSV file download
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> User: Download CSV file
deactivate Frontend

@enduml
